---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Lantern House | Agent Kammer" description="One of the rare Manhattan buildings where the design is the argument." context={{ building: "Lantern House" }}>
  <div class="lh">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="inner">
        <div class="sub-eb top-eb">Building report · West&nbsp;Chelsea</div>
        <h1>Lantern House</h1>
        <p class="dek">One of the rare Manhattan buildings where the design is the argument.</p>

        <div class="hero-unit">
          <div class="photo"><img src="/images/lantern-house.jpg" width="1024" height="682" alt="Lantern House, West Chelsea" /></div>
        </div>

        <h3>Who it suits</h3>
        <div class="tint">
          <div class="fit">
            <div><b>Good fit</b>Professionals who care about design, founders and people who want a home with character.</div>
            <div><b>Possible</b>Finance professionals and international buyers, with more to weigh.</div>
            <div><b>Poor fit</b>Buyers who want value above all, or complete privacy.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

                <p class="verdict-note">Buyer verdicts depend on who you are, how you want to live and what you need from a purchase. <a href="/contact?intent=property&building=Lantern%20House">Request a Property Assessment</a> for a verdict built around your situation.</p>

        <h3>The read</h3>
        <ul class="plain">
          <li>The design is easy to recognize, and that is part of the appeal.</li>
          <li>The building sits close to the neighborhood and the High Line, so the street is part of daily life.</li>
          <li>It feels smaller than most new towers.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>What you give up</h3>
        <ul class="plain">
          <li>There is less privacy than in the trophy buildings.</li>
          <li>Some people find the design too bold.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Compared with</h3>
        <div class="scroll">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Building</th><th>How it differs</th><th>Choose it if</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="n" data-label="Building">One High Line</td><td data-label="How it differs">Feels like a resort, with many amenities</td><td data-label="Choose it if">You want the amenities to be the point</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="n" data-label="Building">565 Broome</td><td data-label="How it differs">Quieter and more private</td><td data-label="Choose it if">Privacy matters more than the design</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="n" data-label="Building">35 Hudson Yards</td><td data-label="How it differs">Corporate, with staff and services on hand</td><td data-label="Choose it if">You want things handled for you</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="n" data-label="Building">The Cortland</td><td data-label="How it differs">On the water, with a family feel</td><td data-label="Choose it if">You want the river and a family setting</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h3>Commute</h3>
        <p>Hudson Yards, Flatiron, Midtown and the Financial District are all within easy reach.</p>

        <p class="fine">Educational only. Not an offer, advice or appraisal. Not an offer, advice or appraisal.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .lh {
    padding: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 24px) max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px)) 40px;
    background-color: #E3E2DE;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='320' height='320'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .5 0 0 0 0 .5 0 0 0 0 .52 0 0 0 .5 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
    --deep: #161C28;
    --label: #4A5058;
    --meta: #5F6672;
    --sep: rgba(22, 28, 40, 0.2);
    --grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #7E858C 0%, #C9CED3 26%, #EEF0F2 46%, #9AA1A8 68%, #7E858C 84%, #C9CED3 100%);
    color: #2F3136;
  }
  .card {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    background: #FBFBFA;
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 26px) clamp(16px, 3vw, 26px) clamp(18px, 2.6vw, 26px);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) inset, 0 2px 4px rgba(22, 28, 40, 0.08), 0 18px 40px rgba(22, 28, 40, 0.16);
    border: 2px solid rgba(47, 49, 54, 0.5);
  }
  .inner { padding: clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px) clamp(14px, 3vw, 30px) 0; }
  .sub-eb {
    text-align: center;
    font: 600 10px/1.4 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif);
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--label);
  }
  .top-eb { margin-top: -28px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  h1 {
    font: 400 clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px) / 1.04 var(--serif, "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif);
    margin: 38px 0 8px;
    color: var(--deep);
  }
  h3 {
    font: 500 clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 30px) / 1.15 var(--serif, "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0.5px var(--deep);
    color: var(--deep);
    margin: 34px 0 12px;
    position: relative;
  }
  h3::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    height: 2px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4A5058 0%, #9AA1A8 35%, #C9CED3 70%, #EEF0F2 100%);
  }
  .tint h3::after { display: none; }
  p { margin: 0; }
  .dek {
    font: italic 400 clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 26px) / 1.35 var(--serif, "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif);
    color: #000;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0.3px #000;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
  }
  .hero-unit {
    background: #F4F4F2;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 10px 10px 0;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(22, 28, 40, 0.12), 0 6px 14px rgba(22, 28, 40, 0.08);
    margin: 20px 0 28px;
  }
  .photo { margin: 0; }
  .photo img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 6px; }
  .pick {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 14px -10px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #D9DDE1;
    border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 18px 20px 22px;
  }
  .pick > div { min-width: 0; }
  .lab { font: 600 11px/1.3 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--deep); }
  .val { font: 600 24px/1.1 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); color: var(--deep); margin-top: 4px; }
  .chip {
    display: inline-block;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font: 600 11px/1 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif);
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    color: #F5F2EB;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3B4A5E, #2A3447 60%, #1E2636);
    border: 1px solid #161C28;
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }
  .tint {
    background: rgba(42, 52, 71, 0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(47, 49, 54, 0.22);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 18px 18px 20px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .fit { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .fit div { font: 400 15px/1.5 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); }
  .fit b { display: block; font: 600 clamp(17px, 1.8vw, 20px) / 1.2 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); color: var(--deep); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  ul.plain { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; }
  ul.plain li { margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 12px 10px 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sep); vertical-align: top; }
  th { font: 600 12px/1.3 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--deep); background: rgba(42, 52, 71, 0.07); padding: 12px 12px; }
  td.n { font: 600 17px/1.2 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); color: var(--deep); white-space: nowrap; }
  .fine { font-size: 12px; color: #000; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 18px; text-align: center; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .fit { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .top-eb { margin-top: -18px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-size: 9px; }
    .pick + .tint { margin-top: 30px; }
    table, tbody, tr, td { display: block; width: 100%; }
    thead { display: none; }
    tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sep); padding: 22px 0; }
    td { border: 0; padding: 2px 0; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 15px; }
    td.n { font: 600 21px/1.2 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--deep); margin-bottom: 14px; }
    td[data-label]::before { content: attr(data-label); display: block; font: 600 10px/1.4 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--label); margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .pick { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 16px 18px; }
    .chip { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 8px 12px; }
    .val { font-size: 22px; }
  }
  .verdict-note { margin: 28px 0 0; font: 400 15px/1.6 var(--sans, Inter, system-ui, sans-serif); color: var(--deep); }
  .verdict-note a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
